<!--
    Themed-icon layer (Android 13+ Material You): the same mark as
    ic_blogmark_mark, flattened to one opaque colour for the system to tint
    from the wallpaper palette.

    Scaled to match ic_launcher_foreground's inset rather than the mark's own
    size, so the themed icon sits in the same air as the colour one — a
    monochrome layer that ran wider would jump when the user turns themed
    icons on.
-->
